1795236214018	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-5506784117328215714"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:34.018-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:34.018-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-virus1"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Published Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Science"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-biology"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"हाम्रो शरीरमा डेरा जमाएर बस्ने भाइरस र जोडिएका क्यान्सरको कथा (भाग १): भाइरस, क्यान्सर र मानिसमा भेटिएको पहिलो अन्कोभाइरस"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"यो लेख पहिलो पटक २०८३ कात्तिक १५ गते शिलापत्रमा “बासभ : समयको उत्खनन” स्तम्भमा प्रकाशित भएको थियो। शिलापत्रमा प्रकाशित लेखको हेडर । हामी धेरैलाई लाग्छ, क्यान्सर चुरोट, रक्सी, खानामा मिसिएको विषादी वा वंशाणुगत रूपमा सरेका डीएनएका गल्तीहरूबाट हुने रोग हो। यी सबै क्यान्सरका कारण हुन्। तर, क्यान्सरका कारण यति मात्रै होइनन्। एउटा अर्को पनि कारण छ, जसबारे हामी धेरैलाई थाहा नहुन सक्छ। त्यो हो, भाइरसको सं"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/5506784117328215714/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sharirma-dera-jamaune-virus-cancer-bhag-1.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/5506784117328215714"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/5506784117328215714"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sharirma-dera-jamaune-virus-cancer-bhag-1.html","title":"हाम्रो शरीरमा डेरा जमाएर बस्ने भाइरस र जोडिएका क्यान्सरको कथा (भाग १): भाइरस, क्यान्सर र मानिसमा भेटिएको पहिलो अन्कोभाइरस"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1pkci91UB4iHy9XQrUvOoMW9oNcNkw_I9=s72-w1200-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}